--- !u!114 &744833603
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 744833601}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 1495c315af60d15499b6fdd4cabcb217, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  textComponent: {fileID: 282647514}
  lines:
  - "Fellow insubordinates, another fortnight till you ooze through the trimester.
    Thee  shan\u2019t not grit thy teeth at the institutional mandible, for it bites. "
  - "Fear not,  greenhorners! Our\u2014MY, canteen; rumors have floated ostensibly
    due to the lack of  grool and the subsequent replacement of thine\u2014well-renowned
    mercy milk."
  - ' It hath  returned! The concavity goeth yonder! In our cuts, Chef Chimney hath
    been  impeached... '
  - ' his flesh and bone filleth with black bile, seeping into the beloved grool!'
  - 'Those among us, those who consumed; should venture across thee Lament Hall in 
    search of Nurse Jijlija. For her gestural techniques, nibbling bone is an effective 
    destroyer of black bile. '
  - ' A final thing, dear insubordinates: hooligan jargon is  outlawed! '
  - ' Frequent production of pseudo-homunculi and their consumption has led  to this...
    jargon. No more, I say! Lest I bringeth the binding mechanisms back in  place.'
  - ' Goeth! My insubordinates, continue you on to thy class.'
  - You! Goeth, I say. Goeth!
  textSpeed: 0.09
